try work for office staff\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-5\",\n   \"text\": \"Give customers visibility into order status and invoices\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-6\",\n   \"text\": \"Provide staff with operational order queues and delivery information\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-7\",\n   \"text\": \"Provide management with basic sales and product reporting\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-8\",\n   \"text\": \"Maintain an auditable history of orders, invoices, customer accounts, and catalogue changes\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-9\",\n   \"text\": \"Implement customer authentication with sign-in, password reset, and account management\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-10\",\n   \"text\": \"Build product catalogue with search, filtering, categories, and vehicle compatibility\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-11\",\n   \"text\": \"Implement customer-specific pricing and price list management\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-12\",\n   \"text\": \"Manage stock availability with ERP CSV imports\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-13\",\n   \"text\": \"Build basket and checkout workflow with delivery date rules\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-14\",\n   \"text\": \"Implement order management with status tracking and staff editing capabilities\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-15\",\n   \"text\": \"Build customer order history, cancellation, and repeat order functionality\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-16\",\n   \"text\": \"Implement invoice creation, viewing, PDF download, and payment tracking\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-17\",\n   \"text\": \"Build administrative tools for product, user, category, and price list management\"\n  }\n ],\n \"touchesUi\": true\n}\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"answers\" kind=\"answers\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-1\",\n  \"question\": \"Is the Customer Account Manager role in the first release? And can a Buyer see all of their company's orders (section 3.1) or only the orders they placed (section 3.2 implies only managers see other users' orders)?\",\n  \"answer\": \"No Account Manager role; every Buyer sees all of their company's orders and invoices\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-2\",\n  \"question\": \"Which invoices can a customer see? Invoices are only created when an order becomes Delivered (section 29), so should the invoice list simply show every invoice that exists for the customer's company?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Customers see every invoice that exists for their company; invoices only exist once the order is Delivered\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-3\",\n  \"question\": \"After confirmation, which status changes can staff make? In particular, can staff cancel a Confirmed or later order for a customer who phones in?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Staff move orders forward one step at a time and can cancel any order that is not yet Delivered\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-4\",\n  \"question\": \"What is recorded in the audit history for customer accounts and catalogue changes, and who can view it?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Who, when, and which fields changed (old and new values); admins only\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-5\",\n  \"question\": \"Can customers create or edit their own delivery addresses, or are addresses maintained only by staff or admins?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Customers can only select from addresses that staff or admins maintain\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-6\",\n  \"question\": \"Customer Buyers can see all of their company's orders. Should saved basket templates also be shared with every Buyer in the company, or stay private to the Buyer who made them?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Templates are private to the Buyer who created them\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-7\",\n  \"question\": \"There is no management role. Who can see the sales and product reports, and which reports are in the first release?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Office staff and admins; sales by period, sales by customer, and top products\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-8\",\n  \"question\": \"How is stock checked when an order is placed or confirmed? Stock only changes with the nightly ERP import, and the portal never decrements it.\",\n  \"answer\": \"Compare the ordered quantity with the last imported quantity, without subtracting orders placed since the import\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"assumptions\" kind=\"assumptions\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q2\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-13\",\n   \"I-15\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-1\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Saved basket templates (section 16) are not in the intent list. Are they in scope for this build? → assumed: Out of scope for this build; only repeat order is built\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q5\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-3\",\n   \"I-11\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-2\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"What happens when a product has no price in the customer's assigned price list? → assumed: The product is shown with 'Price unavailable' and cannot be added to the basket\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q6\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-11\",\n   \"I-16\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-3\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"Are prices stored and shown with or without tax, and do invoices need tax lines? → assumed: All prices exclude tax, and invoices show net amounts only\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q7\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-11\",\n   \"I-16\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-4\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Is there one currency or several? → assumed: A single currency, configured once\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q8\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-12\",\n   \"I-13\",\n   \"I-9\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-5\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Are the 'low stock' threshold, the 14:00 cutoff, and the lockout values (5 attempts, 15 minutes) fixed in code or admin-configurable settings? → assumed: Low-stock threshold and cutoff time are admin settings; lockout values are fixed constants\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q9\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-3\",\n   \"I-12\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-6\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How is 'low stock' worked out from the imported quantity? → assumed: Quantity at or below one global threshold counts as Low stock; zero counts as Out of stock\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q10\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-3\",\n   \"I-13\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-7\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"Can a customer order more than the stock quantity from the last import? Section 8 says an 'unavailable quantity' cannot be ordered. → assumed: Only Out of stock products are blocked; any quantity is allowed otherwise\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q11\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-12\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-8\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How does the nightly ERP CSV reach the portal? → assumed: The ERP drops the file in a configured folder or storage location that the scheduled job reads\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q12\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-12\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-9\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"If the CSV contains product identifiers that don't match any product, what happens? → assumed: Unknown rows are skipped and listed in the import log; matching rows are applied\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q13\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-16\",\n   \"I-5\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-10\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How do we calculate when an invoice becomes Overdue? → assumed: Overdue when unpaid a configurable number of days after the invoice date (one global value)\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q14\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-13\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-11\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How are working days, public holidays and the timezone handled for delivery dates? → assumed: One configured timezone; weekends are non-working, plus a list of holiday dates that admins maintain\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q15\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-13\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-12\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How far ahead can a customer pick a delivery date? → assumed: Any working day from the earliest date up to a configurable number of days ahead\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q16\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-13\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-13\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Does the basket persist across sessions? → assumed: The basket lasts only for the current session\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q18\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-14\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-14\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Is a separate Rejected status needed? → assumed: No; a rejected order is Cancelled with a reason recorded\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"notifications\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q19\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-14\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-15\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Who receives order emails (confirmation, amendment, rejection, out for delivery), especially for staff-created orders? → assumed: Email only, from fixed templates; no SMS or push.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q20\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-9\",\n   \"I-17\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-16\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How long do password reset links and invitations stay valid, and can invitations be resent? → assumed: Reset links last 1 hour; invitations last 7 days and admins can resend them\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q21\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-9\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-17\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Can a locked account request a password reset? → assumed: Yes, but the lock stays until it expires\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q22\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-9\",\n   \"I-17\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-18\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"When a customer company is set to inactive, what happens to its users? → assumed: Its users can't sign in or order, and its history is kept\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q23\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-10\",\n   \"I-17\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-19\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Are categories flat or nested? → assumed: Flat, one level\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q24\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-2\",\n   \"I-10\",\n   \"I-17\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-20\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Vehicle search includes fuel type (section 7.4), but the compatibility data (section 35) has no fuel type. Should fuel type be stored? And how is compatibility data entered? → assumed: Store fuel type in compatibility records; admins enter the data manually\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"reporting\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q25\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-7\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-21\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"What does 'basic sales and product reporting' for management include beyond the staff dashboard? → assumed: On-screen lists with filters and CSV export; no custom report builder.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q27\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-13\",\n   \"I-16\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-22\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"What format should order and invoice numbers use? → assumed: Sequential numbers with a prefix (e.g. ORD-000123, INV-000123)\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"data-migration\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q28\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-10\",\n   \"I-11\",\n   \"I-17\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-23\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"Are existing customers, products, price lists and users loaded at launch? → assumed: No; the system starts empty, with seed data for set-up.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"hosting\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q29\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-1\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-24\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Where is the portal hosted, and which environments are needed? The stack is undecided. → assumed: One cloud region, in the client's cloud account.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"notifications\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-7\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-14\",\n   \"I-6\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-25\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Who receives order emails (confirmation, quantity change, rejection, out for delivery)? This matters especially for orders that staff create on behalf of a customer, where no Buyer placed the order. → assumed: Email only, from fixed templates; no SMS or push.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"notifications\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-8\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-14\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-26\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"When staff cancel an order that is already Confirmed, Picking or Out for delivery, should they have to give a reason, and is the customer emailed the same way as for a rejection? → assumed: Email only, from fixed templates; no SMS or push.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-10\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-12\",\n   \"I-13\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-27\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Where are the low-stock threshold, the 14:00 order cutoff and the system timezone defined? → assumed: Admin-editable system settings, each with a single global value\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-11\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-13\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-28\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How are non-working days and public holidays maintained for the delivery-date rule? → assumed: Weekends are always excluded, and admins maintain a list of extra non-working dates (including public holidays)\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-12\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-13\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-29\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Which delivery dates can a customer choose at checkout? → assumed: Any working day from the earliest available date up to a configurable number of days ahead\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-13\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-11\",\n   \"I-3\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-30\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"What happens when a product has no price on the customer's assigned price list, or the assigned price list has been deactivated? → assumed: The product stays visible but shows 'price on request' and can't be added to the basket\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-14\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-11\",\n   \"I-16\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-31\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"How is tax handled on prices, orders and invoices? → assumed: Prices are entered and shown excluding tax; invoices add tax at one configurable rate\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-15\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-16\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-32\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"When does an unpaid invoice become Overdue? → assumed: After one configurable number of days from the invoice date, the same for all customers\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-17\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-12\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-33\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How does the nightly ERP stock CSV reach the portal? → assumed: A scheduled job reads the file from a configured file location (for example SFTP or a shared folder)\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-18\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-17\",\n   \"I-9\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-34\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"What happens to the users of a customer company that is set to inactive, and to the company's open orders? → assumed: Its users can't sign in or order; open orders and history stay unchanged\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-19\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-13\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-35\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Does the basket persist across sessions and devices? → assumed: Yes, one saved basket per Buyer, kept until the Buyer checks out or empties it\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"sign-in\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-20\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-9\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-36\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How long are password-reset links and invitation links valid, and can admins resend invitations? → assumed: Email and password, with a reset link by email; no social or single s